50:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: Malcolm's looking for some old schematics in the Waste of Souls. This can't be good.
51:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: He's probably overreacting again. Just like with the alchemist situation.
52:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: Nevertheless, we should keep this in mind.
53:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: It's good that you're here.
54:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: You summoned us.
55:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Yes. Our patrols have recently spotted ships with a light green flag. They're sailing from the west; they've already passed the Argonne Sea.
56:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: Another attack?
57:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: We repelled the last one two weeks ago.
58:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: What's the reason? Hanrain hasn't done anything against Agros.
59:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I can't explain it yet. They'll arrive here at dusk today at the earliest. We have to arm ourselves and be ready by then.
60:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: We're safe with the general's armor.
61:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: We've seen phenomena that couldn't be explained. We've visited another world and fought there. How can we be sure KamStar doesn't have its secrets as well? 
62:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: Yes, rightly so...
63:Prepare for an attack from the west. You have 10 minutes.

64:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: King Teryton's attacks are starting to get tiring.
65:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: I don't know about you, but I'm having a blast.
66:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: His troops are dying needlessly. How much longer will we have to endure this?
67:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I'll go to him. I'll speak to him king to king.
68:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: Just come back quickly. I don't want to worry again.
69:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: Relax, Tyrio. What could possibly happen to him with that equipment? 
70:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I'll leave the armor here.
71:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: What? Why?
72:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: If I go out with the armor on, he'll consider it an attack, and I want to talk to him peacefully. Keep an eye on it until I get back.
73:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: No problem.
74:This code might be useful: "/potato_run"